Significance: minor
Type: added

Button blocks get their own settings in the editor's Styles tab: text and background colors with a contrast warning, a Fill or Outline style, and a text size. The published page honors all of them. Width and Border Settings now size the button itself rather than the card around it, so a corner radius has something to round and a width does what it says. A new checkbox controls the "Powered by PayPal" line, which is off unless the merchant turns it on and belongs to the button format alone — the QR code draws the code and its caption and nothing else. The old Light / Auto / Dark preset is gone: it only ever changed the editor, never the published page.
